{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="sg-two-thirds">
  <h1 class="sg-heading-l">Accessibility statement</h1>
  <p>This prototype is built to meet WCAG 2.2 AA principles:</p>
  <ul class="sg-list sg-list--bullet">
    <li>every page is fully keyboard navigable, with a skip link and visible focus states</li>
    <li>semantic HTML landmarks (header, main, footer, nav) and correctly labelled forms</li>
    <li>colour contrast meets AA ratios; status is never conveyed by colour alone — tags carry text</li>
    <li>error messages follow the GOV.UK error-summary pattern and link to the field in error</li>
    <li>no JavaScript is required to use any part of the service</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This is a demonstration service. A live service would publish a full statement including testing results and a feedback route.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
